# Build context for the Cloudflare Containers control-plane image (context is
# this outrunner/ directory). Keep it lean AND keep secrets/.env* out.
# NOTE: runtime-agent/ is intentionally KEPT — the Dockerfile compiles the agent
# binary from it (the binary itself is gitignored, not committed).

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
out

# Secrets / local config — env is injected by the platform, never baked in
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not needed to build the Next app or the Go agent
.context
.hoplite
test
supabase
docs

# The native desktop shell. Excluded for the obvious reason (the control-plane
# image has no use for a Mac app) and one non-obvious one: its Rust target/ dir
# is ~4.4 GB locally, and `COPY . .` was dragging all of it into the build.
# That is what killed three deploys — an OOM, a registry push timeout, and a
# read-only-layer write error. This file predates runtime-desktop being
# committed: it used to be gitignored as "its own git repo".
runtime-desktop

# VCS / misc
.git
.gitignore
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
cloudflare
